Some more context for you:

# Agentic Pipeline Library — Rust Crate Spec
## Pipeline Execution · Resilience · Fuzzy Matching · Caching
> A surface-agnostic Rust library for building agentic workflows.  
> Consumed by CLI binaries and MCP servers alike — neither surface leaks into core.
---
## Design Principles
- **No surface assumptions in core.** Core modules have zero knowledge of TTYs, MCP protocol,
  exit codes, or stdin/stdout. All surface concerns live in opt-in adapter modules.
- **Trait-bounded I/O.** Output, disambiguation, and checkpoint persistence are injected via
  traits. Consumers wire in the right implementation; core never calls `println!` or touches disk.
- **Noop-safe defaults.** Every injected dependency has a zero-cost noop default so the library
  is usable without configuring anything upfront.
- **Typed events over callbacks.** The pipeline emits `AgentEvent` values to an `OutputSink`.
  Surface adapters decide what to do with them — spinners, JSON lines, MCP response bodies, nothing.
- **Phased telemetry.** `TelemetryProvider` is a trait with a `NoopProvider` default.
  Real OTel is a 1-line swap when infrastructure exists.
---
## Crate Layout
```
src/
  lib.rs
  error.rs            — AgentError, Sensitive<T>
  pipeline/
    mod.rs
    executor.rs       — PipelineExecutor, builder
    step.rs           — Step, StepFn, StepStatus, SkipReason
    graph.rs          — level assignment from depends_on edges, cycle detection
    result.rs         — PipelineResult, RunStatus, FailedStep
    checkpoint.rs     — Checkpoint type (pure data, no I/O)
  resilience/
    mod.rs
    policy.rs         — ResiliencePolicy, with_resilience()
    backoff.rs        — exponential backoff, Retry-After parsing
    circuit.rs        — CircuitBreaker (opt-in)
  fuzzy/
    mod.rs
    matcher.rs        — FuzzyMatcher, Match<T> (nucleo-matcher wrapper)
    resolver.rs       — FuzzyResolver, Resolution<T>, Disambiguator trait
  cache/
    mod.rs
    memory.rs         — moka async LRU tier
    disk.rs           — file-based tier, LRU eviction, tag invalidation
    policy.rs         — CachePolicy, TTL, stale-while-revalidate
  telemetry/
    mod.rs            — TelemetryProvider trait, Span trait
    noop.rs           — NoopProvider (default)
  sink/
    mod.rs            — OutputSink trait, AgentEvent, NoopSink (default)
  adapters/           — feature-gated, no surface deps in core
    cli/
      mod.rs
      output.rs       — HumanWriter (indicatif), JsonWriter
      signal.rs       — SIGINT → CancellationToken
      checkpoint.rs   — DiskCheckpointStore
      resolver.rs     — TtyDisambiguator (inquire::Select)
    mcp/
      mod.rs
      output.rs       — McpSink (accumulates events into response body)
      resolver.rs     — McpDisambiguator (returns candidates, no prompt)
      checkpoint.rs   — MemoryCheckpointStore
```
